{"step_index":254,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-17T14:50:48Z","content":"The **System Design Document (`design.md`)** has been created and synced across your local workspace, session artifacts, and Google Drive:\n\n* 📄 **Markdown File (Direct Local Artifact):** [design.md](file:///usr/local/google/home/gauravrawat/.gemini/jetski/brain/ca4322d4-9341-4bd7-ad62-33640faaced0/design.md)\n* 📁 **Workspace Copy:** [design.md](file:///google/src/cloud/gauravrawat/summarize_latest_chats/google3/hr_agentic_solution/design.md)\n* 🔗 **Google Docs Link:** [HR Agentic Solution - System Design Document (MVP 1)](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1ERz1GjU6SybbiuYe05zV-9387A2Jx97sNzBwttVOHcY/edit)\n* 📂 **Google Drive Project Folder:** [HR Agentic Solution - Project Artifacts](https://drive.google.com/corp/drive/folders/115mF5i6YL6YdECFDMdHJoO5gYTXVxEvl)\n\n---\n\n### Key System Design Sections in `design.md`\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                                SYSTEM DESIGN ARCHITECTURE MATRIX                                │\n├───────────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 1. Core Design Principles     │ • Zero-Trust Mock Identity Assertion (Signed JWT via Gateway)   │\n│                               │ • Deterministic State Mutation via Human-in-the-Loop (HITL)     │\n│                               │ • Forward SAGA Consistency with Dead-Letter Queue (DLQ)         │\n│                               │ • Defense-in-Depth Safety Guardrails (Input & Output Filtering) │\n├───────────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 2. Component Topology         │ • Client Web UI (React/SSE), Edge Gateway, Safety Interceptors, │\n│    (Subsystem Specs)          │   Agent Orchestrator (LangGraph), Adapters, Vector DB, & DLQ.   │\n├───────────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 3. Data & Storage Schemas     │ • PostgreSQL DDL for Immutable Audit Logging (`audit_events`)   │\n│                               │ • JSON Schema for Dead-Letter Queue Events (`HROps_DLQ_Event`)  │\n│                               │ • Redis multi-turn session schema (30-minute inactivity TTL)    │\n│                               │ • Vector Database Indexing Schema (Dense Embeddings + Metadata) │\n├───────────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 4. API & Adapter Contracts    │ • `X-Authenticated-User` Signed JWT Claim Contract & HMAC Auth  │\n│                               │ • WorkWeek HCM Adapter (`getProfile`, `getLeave`, `submitLeave`)│\n│                               │ • ServiceImmediately Adapter (`getTicket`, `create`, 15m Dedup)│\n│                               │ • Policy RAG Retrieval Service ($\\ge 0.70$ cosine threshold)   │\n├───────────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 5. Control & Sequence Flows   │ • HITL Confirmation Card State Mutation Sequence                │\n│                               │ • Chained Medical Leave with Forward DLQ Error Recovery         │\n├───────────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 6. Security & Governance      │ • Prompt Injection Defense ($\\ge 99.5\\%$ precision/recall)      │\n│                               │ • NER & Regex SPII Scrubbing (SSNs, Phones, Addresses, Health)  │\n│                               │ • Orchestration-level RBAC check (`caller_id == target_id`)    │\n│                               │ • Automated 30-day log purge & GDPR DSR Compliance Endpoint     │\n├───────────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 7. Resilience & Latency SLAs  │ • Latency Budget: RAG $p95 < 2.8\\text{s}$, Chained $p95 < 6.5\\text{s}$ │\n│                               │ • Circuit Breaker: 3 consecutive 5xx errors trip for 60s        │\n│                               │ • High Availability: 99.9% uptime, RTO $\\le 15\\text{m}$, RPO $\\le 5\\text{m}$│\n├───────────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 8. Infrastructure & CI/CD     │ • Kubernetes / Cloud Pod topology (Autoscaled Gateway & Agent)  │\n│                               │ • CI/CD Quality Gates: $\\ge 85\\%$ Unit Coverage, 100% Safety    │\n└───────────────────────────────┴─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n### Complete Project Deliverables Index in Google Drive:\n\n| Artifact Name | Type | Google Drive Direct Link | Local File Link |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **System Design Document** | Markdown / GDoc | [System Design (GDoc)](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1ERz1GjU6SybbiuYe05zV-9387A2Jx97sNzBwttVOHcY/edit) | [`desi